<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-18T22:14:09.140Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:14:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli forces have launched a ground operation beyond the Yellow Line in central Gaza, prompting civilians to flee shelters, while Israeli settlers shot a 72‑year-old Palestinian woman in the West Bank. An Israeli woman contracted rabies, the first case reported in 2024, and Israeli firms face a quiet boycott as banks tighten credit. Sanctions have been imposed on eight Israeli construction firms building settlements in the West Bank, and the government has frozen the E1 settlement tender process. 21,440 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261118-gazans-flee-shelters-as-israeli-army-launches-ground-operation-beyond-yellow-line&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/18/world/asia/myanmar-rohingya-muslim-genocide-world-court.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqrlg377638yo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/18/israel-construction-contracts-e1-west-bank-settlement-uk-sanctions&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/18/world-bank-official-says-lebanon-reconstruction-making-slow-progress?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/18/australia-sanctions-construction-company-west-bank-settlement-expansion-ntwnfb&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/15/myanmar-rohingya-genocide-icj&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168796&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&l